// REPLACES:
//   - KalmanEngineLib (entire file)
//   - EntropyLib (entire file: entropy + changepoint + Kalman duplicates)
//   - chainaggrLib MicroState + get_micro_state + get_scientific_delta + get_aggregated_volume
//
// REMOVED DUPLICATES:
//   - TaUtilityLib.KalmanState (price/velocity 2D) → use KalmanStateN with nfeat=2
//   - TaUtilityLib f_kalman_update / f_kalman_update_te / f_kalman_robust / f_kalman_control
//     → all subsumed by KalmanStateN methods
//   - EntropyLib f_sequential_kalman_update → KalmanStateN.update_scalar
